1
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:07,449
The Synthograsizer turns a prompt into an instrument.

2
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:10,785
Each knob controls a variable, so you can explore

3
00:00:10,785 --> 00:00:13,795
new combinations without rewriting your idea.

4
00:00:13,978 --> 00:00:18,286
Switch to the D-pad for focused navigation, or browse the built-in

5
00:00:18,286 --> 00:00:22,211
library for generative art, characters, stories, and music.

6
00:00:22,586 --> 00:00:25,306
Start with a template, then make it your own.

7
00:00:29,192 --> 00:00:31,405
Prompt Batch turns one template

8
00:00:31,405 --> 00:00:33,948
into a whole collection of prompts.

9
00:00:34,108 --> 00:00:37,583
For each variable, choose whether to lock it, randomise

10
00:00:37,583 --> 00:00:40,995
it, step through its values in order, or repeat them.

11
00:00:41,438 --> 00:00:44,916
Set the batch size and an output format, then generate.

12
00:00:45,478 --> 00:00:49,294
Review the list, copy it all, or download it for another tool.
